#. type: Title #
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote access (Tunnel + Service API Token)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Hub 业务 API（REST / SAP / MCP）须带 **per-subject Service API Token**（`Authorization: Bearer fa_at_...`）。\n"
"> Security context: [`security.md`](security.md) · Install: [`install.md`](install.md)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer                   | Role                                                                                                        |\n"
"| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Service API Token**   | 绑定 `user` / `agent` subject；REST `Authorization: Bearer`；SAP `connect.auth_token`；MCP `/mcp` 同 Bearer |\n"
"| **CLI bootstrap**       | `anima token create --subject-id <id> --name bootstrap`（直连 PG，不经 HTTP）                               |\n"
"| **cloudflared**         | Outbound tunnel；single hostname → Hub `127.0.0.1:2658`（API + Web UI at `/web`）                           |\n"
"| **`http.host`**         | Hub listen bind (IP or resolvable hostname); default `127.0.0.1`; use `0.0.0.0` for LAN                     |\n"
"| **`http.cors_origins`** | Explicit cross-origin browser origins (dev:web, split UI/API reverse proxy); independent of Tunnel          |\n"
"| **Client settings**     | app/desktop / app/mobile / **browser Web** fill Hub URL and token in **Hub settings**                       |\n"
"| **Remote UI**           | Desktop / Mobile 默认从 Hub `/web/*` 加载 UI；见 [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md) Client UI |\n"
"| **PWA**                 | `/web/*` 支持 manifest + Service Worker；手机浏览器与 APK 共用 compact 布局                                 |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:24
msgid "仅 `GET /api/health`、CORS 预检、`/api/echo` 豁免认证。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. 创建 token（冷启动）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima token create --subject-id 1 --name bootstrap\n"
"# 终端打印 fa_at_...（仅此一次）→ 填入客户端 Hub 设置\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:33
msgid "列出 / 撤销："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima token list --subject-id 1\n"
"anima token revoke <token_id>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:40
msgid "Admin REST（需已认证 `full` token）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:44
msgid "`GET /api/subjects/:id/tokens`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:44
msgid ""
"`POST /api/subjects/:id/tokens` — body `{ \"name\": \"desktop\" }`，响应含一"
"次性 `plaintext`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:44
msgid "`DELETE /api/tokens/:id`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Listen address (`http.host`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default bind is `127.0.0.1:2658` (loopback only). For LAN access via `http://<PC-IP>:2658/web` or a local hostname such as `http://galaxy:2658/web`, set:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host: 0.0.0.0\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:55
msgid ""
"Multiple binds (distinct interfaces only — not client-facing aliases). Use "
"`0.0.0.0` instead of listing every IP; do not mix `0.0.0.0` with specific "
"addresses. Hostnames must resolve on the Hub machine (`/etc/hosts` or DNS):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  host:\n"
"    - 127.0.0.1\n"
"    - 10.244.0.2\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:64
msgid ""
"CLI `--host` overrides config for a single run / systemd unit write. After "
"changing `http.host`, run `anima service restart`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Without Tunnel, LAN: `http://<PC-IP>:2658/web/chat` with `http.host: 0.0.0.0` (or `anima service start --host 0.0.0.0`); clients set Hub URL to `http://<PC-IP>:2658` (no `/web` suffix).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cross-origin (`http.cors_origins`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:70
msgid ""
"When the browser UI and Hub API share the same origin (default: `https://"
"anima.example.com/web` + `https://anima.example.com/api`), **no CORS config "
"is needed**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:72
msgid ""
"Add origins only for **cross-origin** cases (e.g. Vite dev server, external "
"reverse proxy splitting UI and API):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"http:\n"
"  cors_origins:\n"
"    - http://127.0.0.1:4173\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:80
msgid "CORS is **not** derived from `tunnel` or `web.public_url`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Tunnel (optional)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anima tunnel setup\n"
"anima service start\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:89
msgid ""
"When `tunnel.enabled: true`, cloudflared starts with **`anima service "
"start`** stack (no separate `anima-tunnel.service`). Ingress points to Hub "
"`:2658` only; Web UI is served at **`/web`** on the same hostname."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tunnel:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  hostname: anima.example.com\n"
"\n"
"web:\n"
"  enabled: true\n"
"  public_url: https://anima.example.com/web\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:101
msgid ""
"Browser: `https://anima.example.com/web/chat` · Hub API: `https://"
"anima.example.com/api`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "Without Tunnel, LAN: `http://<PC-IP>:2658/web/chat` with `http.host: 0.0.0.0` in config (see above); clients set Hub URL to `http://<PC-IP>:2658` (no `/web` suffix).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cloudflare credentials (pass)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:110
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| pass path                                | Purpose                       |\n"
"| ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n"
"| `services/cloudflare/api-token`          | Create Tunnel / DNS           |\n"
"| `services/cloudflare/tunnel-credentials` | `cloudflared` connector creds |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:112
msgid "See wizard `anima tunnel setup`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Client configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "**app/desktop**, **app/mobile**, and **browser Web** are remote clients; they **do not read** Hub `config.yaml` token.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:122
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Client      | Storage                                          |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| app/desktop | `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json` (`hub` section) |\n"
"| app/mobile  | Capacitor Preferences                            |\n"
"| Browser Web | localStorage (settings page)                     |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:124
msgid "Settings (all clients):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:127
msgid ""
"**Hub URL** — e.g. `https://anima.example.com` or `http://192.168.1.10:2658` "
"(Hub root, **without** `/web`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:127
msgid "**Hub API Token** — `fa_at_...` from `anima token create`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:129
msgid ""
"Browser Web: `/web/config.json` sets default Hub to the page origin; first "
"visit still requires saving token in settings."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:131
msgid ""
"Flow: open Hub settings → fill → **Test connection** → Save. Desktop "
"requires **restart app/desktop** after save."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Authentication behavior"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:134
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"REST:  Authorization: Bearer fa_at_<prefix>_<secret>\n"
"SAP:   WebSocket /sap/v1 → connect frame includes auth_token\n"
"MCP:   POST/GET /mcp → Authorization: Bearer <token>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:141
msgid ""
"`/web/*` static assets skip service auth; `/api` and `/mcp` require Bearer "
"token."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:143
msgid "Missing or invalid token → HTTP `401` or SAP connection closed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. MCP outbound (external agents query Hub data)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:147
msgid ""
"Hub serves Streamable HTTP MCP Server at **`/mcp`**, exposing read-only "
"tools from ToolSets with `expose_mcp: true` (e.g. `memory_recall`, "
"`conversation_search`). External MCP clients (Cursor, Claude Desktop, etc.) "
"connect **without LLM relay**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:148
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# External agent example (Cursor mcp.json, etc.)\n"
"mcpServers:\n"
"  freeanima:\n"
"    url: http://127.0.0.1:2658/mcp\n"
"    headers:\n"
"      Authorization: \"Bearer fa_at_...\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:159
msgid ""
"**Inbound** (Hub connects to external MCP servers): `config.yaml` "
"`mcp_servers` (`capabilities/mcp-client`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:159
msgid ""
"**Outbound** (external agents call Hub tools): `/mcp` endpoint "
"(`capabilities/mcp-server`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "Operations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:169
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command                          | Description                                    |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `anima token create/list/revoke` | Service API Token 管理（CLI，直连 PG）         |\n"
"| `anima tunnel status`            | Tunnel / cloudflared status                    |\n"
"| `anima tunnel start` / `stop`    | Manual cloudflared (production: service stack) |\n"
"| `anima web start --foreground`   | Standalone Web static server (debug, `/web`)   |\n"
"| `anima service status`           | Hub / Tunnel stack                             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:180
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                | Check                                                               |\n"
"| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Public 502             | Is Hub running? `anima service status`                              |\n"
"| Public 1033            | `anima tunnel status` shows `connected: no`                         |\n"
"| 401                    | Client token valid; run `anima token list --subject-id <id>`        |\n"
"| Local OK, remote fails | Remote requests need Bearer / SAP auth_token                        |\n"
"| CORS error in browser  | Add UI origin to `http.cors_origins`, or use Hub `/web` same-origin |\n"
"| 401 after token change | Update client settings; revoke old tokens if needed                 |\n"
msgstr ""

